<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that Cross-Continent Auto Retailers Inc, York International Corp and OHM Corp were unavailable for after hours trading for news.</p>
<p>The exchange also said that Buenos Aires Embotelladora, Corimon SACA and Edison Brothers Stores Inc were unavailable in after hours trading.</p>
</text>
